	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quas tu ad me literas dedisti, vel mit<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tendas d. <persName ref="p8121">Christophoro Montio</persName> vel <persName ref="p505">Ioanni Burchero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglo</placeName>, <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> diligentissime curavi per certos et <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>notos homines nec dubito, quin redditę sint.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid autem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> noster cum literis tuis egerit aut quibus dederit, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ignoro.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nonne saepe te admonui, ut, si quid vis curatum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName>, ut ad me mittas?</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">nemo enim commodius potest <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>mittere quam ego, qui nautas nostros novi ac vectores.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> aegrotat, nec erat locus interrogandi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Praeterea nec te hoc latere volo me diligentissime, quas <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ad d. <persName>Maurilium</persName> misisti, curasse; dedi enim eas civi optimo <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et intimo d. <persName>Maurilio</persName>, qui res suas <placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> curat, imo omnium <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l832">Gallorum</placeName>; itaque omnem dubitationem abiice.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Accepit literas, scio, ac <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>regi misit; quod autem nihil rescribit, ne mireris; fortassis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ex istis comitiis accipies ab eo literas, aut legatus vester erit <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>viva epistola.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Caeterum nunc temporis nihil habeo studiis tuis dignum, quod <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>scribam.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Captus est 27. novembris miles quidam nomine <persName>Guͦtschück</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>qui ductor fuit <placeName ref="l875">Hispanici</placeName> exercitus ad <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName>; fuit olim <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>cives <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensis</placeName>, sed propter homicidium vix aufugerat.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Is apud <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nos hęsit ad sesquiannum; sed eiectus est ex nostra urbe; causam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>adhuc ignoro exactam.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Abiit indignabundus ac verba quędam effudit, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nempe se velle nostros in balneum ducere, quemadmodum <placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName> duxerit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Cognitis iis minis noctu captus est in pago episcopali et ductus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>in carcerem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Literę proditorię inventę sunt, quas ad illum misere ca<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>pitanei <placeName>Caesareani</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Qua de re fusius brevi.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Domino <persName ref="p2916">Schertlino</persName> insidi<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>atus est, idque etiam intellexit egregius et pius vir.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Sic apparet <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>dominum impios debito tempore ad poenam rapere, quum nihil mali sperant <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>imminere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Multi ex <placeName ref="l378">Lutetia</placeName> et passim ex <placeName ref="l832">Galliis</placeName> docti viri ad nos quotidie <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>veniunt patriam repetentes; nam <placeName>Gallus</placeName> omnes iussit abire, qui <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>sub Caesare et <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinando</persName> rege vivunt.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Bellum gravissimum imminet.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Peste <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>gravamur, annona omnium fere rerum premimur.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quid agendum censes?</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">V<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>igilandum et precandum, quo liceat nobis effugere omnia ista, quę ventura sunt super <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>totum terrę orbem; nam redemptio nostra prope est.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">In die Andre<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ę <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>T[uus] <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Fideli Christi ministr<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>o d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Bullingero</persName> apud <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName>, praeceptori suo <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>charissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
